### Apple Human Interface Guidelines

`references/*.md` (other than `fluid-motion-web.md`) are compiled from Apple's
publicly available Human Interface Guidelines at
<https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/> (snapshot:
2026-09). Apple's documentation is subject to
[Apple's own terms](https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/terms/site.html);
the text here is a Chinese-language adaptation and summary of those guidelines,
following the original's structure and wording where fidelity matters; it is not
an official Apple publication.
